WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
- Many are upset that Biden's DOJ

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.120
seems to be defending President Trump

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.210
in the E. Jean Carroll case,

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.990
where he is accused of sexual assault.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:11.830
And this one is more
complicated than it seems.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.080
This all relates to the Westfall Act

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.300
which basically gives immunity to

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.530
employees of the government

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.920
who undertake actions

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.520
in the course of their employment.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.010
And it's not unreasonable to assume

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:23.448
that allegations of sexual assault

00:00:23.448 --> 00:00:26.530
don't relate to the course
and scope of your employment

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:27.363
as a federal employee,

00:00:27.363 --> 00:00:29.339
but it's more complicated than that.

00:00:29.339 --> 00:00:31.347
The E. Jean Carroll case relates
to former President Trump's

00:00:31.347 --> 00:00:33.470
statements while in office,

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.710
she's accusing him of defamation
by denying the allegations,

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.420
and defenders of this move point out that

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.210
politicians have to talk
about their personal lives

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.460
in office all the time.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:43.389
Number two, that if
these kinds of statements

00:00:43.389 --> 00:00:46.448
we're not immune, you get
all kinds of crazy suits

00:00:46.448 --> 00:00:48.779
anytime any politician said anything.

00:00:48.779 --> 00:00:50.749
And number three, there
is prior case law where

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:52.829
a politician has received
Westfall immunity

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:55.890
when talking about their
personal lives in office.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:56.723
But bottom line,

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.253
this is a complicated issue
and there are no easy answers.

